WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.370
Hi, I'm Liz. Maybe you want to eat out without guessing,

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:07.000
find your people, or do more for the animals than you are right now.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.700
Wherever you're starting from, this Guide is how you get there.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:15.100
You'll start out just looking around, and you'll finish knowing your city,

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:20.000
your community, and exactly where you fit in. Let's go.

00:00:19.984 --> 00:00:23.384
Why listen to us? We've spent more than ten years

00:00:23.384 --> 00:00:26.304
inside this community: activism, events,

00:00:26.304 --> 00:00:30.364
content, running businesses, and hundreds of long conversations

00:00:30.364 --> 00:00:33.964
about what people needed. Now we can finally build it,

00:00:33.964 --> 00:00:35.584
and we can't get it right without you.

00:00:35.814 --> 00:00:39.594
Search for anything and it shows up.

00:00:39.594 --> 00:00:42.814
The Directory has places to eat and shop, people,

00:00:42.814 --> 00:00:45.814
groups and nonprofits, city by city.

00:00:45.814 --> 00:00:50.374
Your city has its own Daily Pulse, its boards and its events.

00:00:50.374 --> 00:00:53.114
And our Guides each walk you through one topic.

00:00:53.264 --> 00:00:55.664
Vote for the places you love.

00:00:55.664 --> 00:00:58.464
Your favorites tell us who to spotlight next.

00:00:58.464 --> 00:01:01.964
Check in when you visit and take on bounties to earn points.

00:01:01.964 --> 00:01:05.164
Spend them to open Guides and ask your Guide anything,

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:08.464
or give them to the places and causes you care about.

00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:11.164
And points keep getting more valuable:

00:01:11.164 --> 00:01:15.064
giveaways, special opportunities and discounts are on the way,

00:01:15.064 --> 00:01:18.179
and the local businesses and nonprofits you give them to

00:01:18.179 --> 00:01:21.294
will be able to use them for promotion through us.

00:01:21.293 --> 00:01:24.453
Everyone starts as an Explorer. Run a restaurant,

00:01:24.453 --> 00:01:27.713
host events, make content or work with a nonprofit?

00:01:27.713 --> 00:01:31.093
Each one has its own path, its own Guide and its own badge.

00:01:31.272 --> 00:01:34.832
This is the part that matters most.

00:01:34.832 --> 00:01:38.132
Use it in your day to day, and tell us what's working,

00:01:38.132 --> 00:01:41.372
what isn't, and what you wish you could do.

00:01:41.372 --> 00:01:44.052
Every page has a Feedback button.

00:01:44.052 --> 00:01:47.292
Ask your Guide, or ask a person on our team.

00:01:47.292 --> 00:01:50.792
Search for something we don't have yet, and it goes to our team.

00:01:50.792 --> 00:01:54.512
We read all of it, and we build from it every day.

00:01:54.512 --> 00:01:57.972
We're real people, supported by technology that finally lets

00:01:57.972 --> 00:02:01.372
us carry out a vision we've been working on since 2016.

00:02:01.443 --> 00:02:04.603
Here's where it's all going. With a network of businesses,

00:02:04.603 --> 00:02:07.343
people and nonprofits that actually show up,

00:02:07.343 --> 00:02:09.443
we can run campaigns that move the needle

00:02:09.443 --> 00:02:11.543
for the animals, the reason we're all here.

00:02:11.709 --> 00:02:14.309
Right now you're early, and that's rare.

00:02:14.309 --> 00:02:17.709
If you feel you know enough, take the survey and get started right

00:02:17.709 --> 00:02:20.569
away. It's a few quick questions,

00:02:20.569 --> 00:02:23.269
about two minutes, and you're in, free,

00:02:23.269 --> 00:02:27.089
with 250 points to use across the platform.

00:02:27.089 --> 00:02:31.369
Want to take your time? Each section of this Guide breaks down exactly

00:02:31.369 --> 00:02:34.369
how to use it today. Either way,

00:02:34.369 --> 00:02:37.969
join before midnight on January first and you're a Founding Member

00:02:37.969 --> 00:02:42.029
for good. Founders unlock some really cool things in 2027,

00:02:42.029 --> 00:02:44.169
and the only way to hear about them, and

00:02:44.169 --> 00:02:46.309
lock them in for yourself, is to join today.
